            "title": "盤中速報 - 松川精密(7788)股價拉至漲停，漲停價198.5元，成交2,607張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>松川精密(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7788:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7788\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7788-TW</a>)23日09:37上漲18元，股價漲停報198.5元，委買263張，成交2,607張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為繼電器。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>松川精密(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7788:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7788\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7788-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌8.61%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌17.5%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：+524 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-2,256 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：+2,810 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-30 張</li> <li>融資增減：-575 張</li> <li>融券增減：+46 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
            "link": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6669997",
